<title>USA: Northeast Bancorp acquire Cushnoc.</title>
<headline>Northeast Bancorp acquire Cushnoc.</headline>
<dateline>AUBURN, Maine 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northeast Bancorp said Friday it has agreed to acquire Cushnoc Bank and Trust Co in a stock exchange worth $2.6 million.</p>
<p>The company said the deal is expected to close in the third or fourth quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The company said it will issue 2.089 shares of its stock for each share of Cushnoc stock.</p>
<p>Cushnoc has 9,000 shares of common stock outstanding. Northeast has about 1.3 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The company said Cushnoc will be merged into its Northeast Bank FSB subsidiary.</p>
</text>
